1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
When you only want to change a layout, rebuilding the entire image can change the subject or composition.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Choose a canvas size and upload a background, or explicitly generate one with the paid background API.

3
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Describe what to keep and press Create local cutout. Local models create the transparent PNG without an API charge.

4
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Place the subject, tune it locally, and add editable text layers.

5
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Final-quality adjustment runs in the browser without an API call.

6
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Preview and PNG export use the same Canvas renderer.

7
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Originally created in Japanese. English translation assisted by ChatGPT and reviewed by the creator.
